  "changes": "Isolated ModelDock system paths/interface names; recomputed Windows Wintun interface GUID; independent recovery state directories without selecting test backends; ModelDock self-loop rejection; fixed script entry for embedded Python signal delivery; tests pin KDE or inject POSIX cache paths only for mock Windows cores. Original Qt GUI/storage/autostart are not imported. Namespace harness expects the ModelDock root-helper runtime path. ModelDock owns the Linux authorization prompts and service descriptions. Linux setup guidance and the bundled phone instructions refer to the integrated ModelDock application. Per-user system sockets require a trusted root grant as well as kernel peer identity; grant revocation gracefully shuts down the active helper.",
